{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_04",
  "title": "烤串與預言",
  "storyCode": "DT-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "05583df17978bd63107dc6ac7437ddd5fb3a6813c43adc4d3623ba2e1c63ecc2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "我的名字是艾爾啟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "我預見到今天在這片森林中會有厄運降臨，於是來到這附近徘徊，結果發現了在雪地裡昏倒的你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……你有看到我的同伴們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……嘖，我得去找他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "你傷得不輕，先在這裡休息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "你似乎不是薩米人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……我和我的夥伴們在尋找回家的線索，有一個叫橡杯的人告訴我們，薩米的意志指引我們往北走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "橡杯……橡樹之子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你認識他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "我只是有所耳聞，這個名字在薩米與“智慧”同義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "“智慧”……？那……你知道獨眼巨人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "我見過許多人被厄運纏身，死亡……並不是一件少見的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "但是，為什麼我在你的身上看到了許多死亡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "還是沒找到奇爾查克嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "唯一值得慶幸的是，這附近的積雪非常厚，而且樹木繁多，以奇爾查克的身手，他應該不會有大問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "嗯……但是奇爾查克缺乏自保能力，我們還是要儘快找到他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "要是讓他遇到那頭跑走的奇怪角獸那就凶多吉少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "我知道。而且，我們現在還有一個問題——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "唉……這不怪你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "不過，小姐，為什麼你會一個人在這片森林裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "因為我在這裡打獵……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "孩子，你生活在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "不是喔，我生活在羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "羅德島？！我們正在找羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "欸？你們要去羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "嗯，我們正在找回家的路，據說羅德島上會有線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "你們找不到家了嗎？好可憐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "你可以帶我們去找羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "欸，但是我還不想回去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "因為我還沒吃夠呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "沒有吃夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "如果我們讓你吃飽的話，你願意帶我們去羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "嗯，可以喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "……沒想到，真的在這種地方找到了線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "難道說，其實這就是薩米的指引？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "我還沒找到這次的獵物呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "我們有食物——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "看來我們的食物也在剛才丟失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "……不然你看這樣可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "你先幫我們找到我們的同伴，然後，我們一起幫你狩獵你想要的獵物，最後，你帶我們去羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "嗯！好喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "真是個純真的孩子。你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "我是刻俄柏，你們可以叫我小刻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你在我身上看到了死亡……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "許多死亡，從過去延綿到未來，但你卻活著站在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "那個橡杯說，獨眼巨人能看到未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你是獨眼巨人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "那麼現在，告訴我，我的命運是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "……獨眼巨人只能看到厄運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "厄運也沒關係，告訴我，我的命運，我夥伴的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "你的夥伴們向著無盡冰原走去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "不，他們並不是自願往北走的，他們……被黑暗、被虛無吞噬了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "他們被邪魔污染了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "邪魔？！那是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "邪魔……是遊蕩在這片土地上的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "它們會侵蝕和覆蓋一切物質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "而被邪魔污染的生物，會失去一切的自我，如同被虛無吞噬一般——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "臉上會有一個圓……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "就像是臉上有一隻眼一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "……你、你們已經看過被邪魔污染的生物了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奇爾查克思索了片刻，捂著受傷的手臂，朝著洞外走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "厄運是可以避免的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾爾啟",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_969_1",
      "text": "對於這個問題，我的回答是——我在嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "……那我也該試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "也就是說，羅德島是一艘巨大的艦船？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "嗯！羅德島超大的，而且會開去各種各樣的地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "啊，難怪我們一直都找不到它的位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "（嗅嗅）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "是血的味道，是我的獵物，“獨眼怪”就在這附近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "……真是敏銳的嗅覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "嗯？小刻，你剛才說，“獨眼怪”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "對啊，這個角獸臉上只有一隻眼睛，不就是”獨眼怪”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "咦……你們還記得橡杯說的話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "他說的是獨眼巨人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "會不會獨眼巨人只是他的推斷，而不是結論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "會不會薩米意志的意思並不是讓我們去找獨眼巨人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "其實是祂預知到了我們會遇到小刻，也知道我們會遇到這種“角獸”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "無論如何，既然在這裡遇到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "就先解決掉牠吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "牠死透了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "呼……這樣也算幫奇爾查克出了口氣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "我們快去找他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "老夫有個建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "與其在這裡漫無目的地尋找奇爾查克，不如就地生火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "雖然也有把野獸引來的可能性，但是奇爾查克也能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "嗯……可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，餓著肚子幹什麼都不會有效率的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "……確實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "就算最後他沒來，我們先填飽肚子也能更有效率地去找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "這頭“獨眼”角獸怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "我們一起吃掉牠吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "嗯，老夫也認為應該吃掉牠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "老夫聽說過一些習俗，在有些地方，人們會選擇殺掉用於祭祀的動物並吃掉牠，希望以此獲得神靈的啟示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "老夫猜測，薩米的意志可能也希望我們這樣做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "別掩飾了，你從一開始就抱著這個念頭吧，萊歐斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "那麼，開始生火吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "但願奇爾查克能夠看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "可以吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "嗚——說真的，這個肉看起來好詭異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "老夫已經品嚐過了，和普通的肉沒什麼太大的區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "好吧，比這更詭異的東西我也吃過了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "真的還蠻好吃的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "小刻——你在那邊幹什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "我在這邊看看還有沒有別的大傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "唔，好像沒有了，但是也沒看到掉下去的那個杜林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "先過來一起吃吧，然後我們一起去找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "好，我馬上就來——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "喂——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "啊，你是摔下去的杜林！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "呼——呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你是竄出來的那傢伙……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "對不起，我害你掉下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "呼……呼……沒關係，比起這個，你們沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "嗯，我們沒事喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "我就說嘛，厄運果然是可以避免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "他們正在那邊烤肉，打算填飽肚子就去找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "我們一起過去吧，他們見到你肯定很高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "嘖，這幫傢伙，真是什麼時候都不會忘了吃，虧我還這麼擔心他們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "等等，烤肉？烤什麼肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "“獨眼怪”的肉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "“獨眼怪”？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你們……該不會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "啊，他們過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "剛好，這下子我必須好好唸唸他們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "我說你們啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奇爾查克轉過身去，剛想要好好說說丟下自己烤肉的夥伴們。\n然而，話到嘴邊卻卡住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "該回家了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "我們在這個世界待了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "法琳一定等急了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "魔像上種的菜該收了，炎龍還在等著老夫去料理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們的臉，已經不是自己熟悉的面孔，而是被虛空覆蓋。\n他們發出的聲音，也變得有些斷斷續續，奇爾查克甚至無法判斷，他們是從哪裡發聲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你們……把被邪魔污染的角獸吃了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "齊爾■■，你為什麼還■在那裡？走■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "法琳，法■，■■——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你們……你們要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "北邊，去北■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "盡頭，門，回家，回■■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "北邊有一扇可以回家的門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "這是薩米的指引的含義嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "但是你們是怎麼知道的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "我們■■，我們來自那■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "■■回那■■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "text": "甬首，豕，去林——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "text": "■■■，■■，■■■。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "text": "■■■■■■■■■■■炎龍■■■■■■！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一時間，奇爾查克的心情無比複雜。\n他感到驚慌失措——看來厄運的確無法避免，自己的隊友陷入了非常令人擔憂的狀態，他卻有些無能為力。\n但他又有點生氣……\n因為當下的情況……根本就是他們自作自受啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奇爾查克確信自己只是眨了一下眼，但是三個人不知為何已經出現在了距離他很近的地方。\n而下一秒，他們就來到了自己的身邊。\n從他的視角來看，他們完全就是一閃一閃地在移動，彷彿空間也被他們臉上的空洞吞噬了一樣。\n很快，他們就消失在了樹林深處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奇爾查克呆立片刻，終於還是深深嘆了口氣。\n他聽到了身後獨眼巨人趕來的腳步聲，也看到了不遠處那個女孩臉上疑惑的表情。\n但他沒有停留，而是邁開腳步向著他們消失的方向追趕而去。\n他覺得自己有點不好意思向那位會用憂傷的目光注視著他的女性解釋究竟發生了什麼。\n而且，終究是自己的夥伴……總不能真的就看著他們這樣跑走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "text": "你們——倒是——跑慢一點啦——！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "憤怒的吼聲在黑森林的上空迴盪，久久沒有散去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "text": "等等我呀，我也要跟你們一起去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
